get.description:
(Site, service) pairs a new RAMS may name, from ``build_offer_pairs``.

A WARRANTY project has no offer, so its pairs come from its scope items;
the create modal reads them for its service and site pickers.

CreateTeamMessagePayload.description:
Payload for a dispatcher message to a team, dated today or later
(DISP-2288). Images are pre-uploaded via ``POST /core/v1/files/`` (bare);
their ids are passed here to be linked in the same transaction.

RamsTemplateBulkEditBody.description:
Body for applying one content change to a whole selection of templates.

``field_updates`` sets individual fields and leaves their siblings alone;
``form_data`` replaces whole table sections. At least one must be non-empty.
